PRIVILEGE MANAGEMENT

Privilege levels:

* Guest
* User
* Power User
* Administrator
* Root
* Read-Only Root
* Container Root
* Remote Root

Privilege escalation ALWAYS requires authorization.

Supported authorization methods:

* Password
* Security key (FIDO2/YubiKey)
* Biometrics
* Smart card
* Authentication application
* Policy-based authorization

No silent privilege escalation.

No automatic root elevation.

No plugin bypass of authorization system.

Every elevation request must:

* Display requested privilege level
* Display requesting action
* Require user approval

